stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Validating
    Validating --> Refused: Invalid options or conflicting flags
    Validating --> Launching: Allocate one lease and call engine
    Launching --> Active: Engine returns a browser
    Launching --> Released: Launch rejects or child exits or times out
    Active --> Closing: Caller closes browser
    Active --> Released: Browser disconnects
    Closing --> Released: Close succeeds or rejects
    Closing --> Closing: Concurrent close shares promise
    Released --> Released: Repeated close shares result
    Refused --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
    %% never: A refused launch starts a browser.
    %% never: Releasing one lease removes an unrelated directory.
    %% never: A repeated close calls the engine twice.
